  "shortName": "TitanStrobeFLEXFX",
  "description": "Titan Strobe FLEX FX is a set of 8 high-power LED strobes and a dedicated controller. Each individual pod has a powerful cold white 100-watt COB LED for strobing and a ring of 12 individually controllable 2-watt RGBW LEDs. The integrated RGBW LEDs allow you to create unique full-color LED ring effects. The powerful LED light source combined with a strobe functionality allows you to use the Titan Strobe FLEX FX as a strobe light with bright color effects. It uses a Fresnel lens to create the optimum beam angle. The light effect can be controlled via DMX/RDM, Art-Net, sACN and Master/Slave, but can also run in stand-alone mode with several built-in programs.\n\nThe strobe pods have a special mounting bracket with 4 holes at a 45-degree angle, so you don’t have to detach the pod from it to drill through the holes to mount it. The bracket also has a 12.5 mm hole, while the controller has two 12.5 mm holes and an M10 threaded insert for attaching a clamp. You can also attach a quick lock bracket to the controller and pods. The pods and controller have a robust IP65-rated aluminum enclosure and are ready for outdoor shows. Dedicated 4x 2.5 m and 4x 5 m cables with control signals and power are included. Additional dedicated cables of various lengths are available separately (maximum length allowed: 30 m).",
